          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "A funnel-web of upland rainforest and wet sclerophyll forest in southern Queensland, described from specimens collected in montane habitat on the Queensland–NSW border ranges. Like most Hadronyche it builds a retreating burrow lined with silk and fitted with a collar and trip-lines.",
