          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "A funnel-web described from coastal and hinterland forests of NSW, one of several Hadronyche species recognized from the highly diverse spider fauna of the New South Wales coast ranges. Medium-sized; inhabits moist forest gullies where it builds silk-lined burrows under bark, in rotting logs, or in soft clay banks.",
