          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "A funnel-web described from the forests of New South Wales and southern Queensland, one of several Hadronyche species identified through systematic survey work on the Atracidae of eastern Australia in recent decades. Ground-dwelling; builds a characteristic funnel-web burrow with radiating signal threads in moist forest soil.",
